    <div class="story">
      Write a short, warm story about yourself here. Where you grew up, what makes you smile, what you're dreaming about these days. It doesn't have to be fancy, just sound like you talking to a friend over tea.
      <div class="sig hand">— your name</div>
    </div>
    <div class="nums">
      <div class="num"><div class="n" data-c="21">0</div><span>years of being me</span></div>
      <div class="num"><div class="n" data-c="365">0</div><span>sunsets watched (ish)</span></div>
      <div class="num"><div class="n" data-c="99">0</div><span>cups of coffee ☕</span></div>
      <div class="num"><div class="n" data-c="7">0</div><span>houseplants kept alive 🌱</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="skills" class="reveal">
    <h2>Things I'm good at <span class="hand">(and learning)</span></h2>
