      <div class="fav"><h3 class="hand">🎧 Songs on repeat</h3><ul><li>Song title one</li><li>Song title two</li><li>Song title three</li></ul></div>
      <div class="fav"><h3 class="hand">🎞️ Watching &amp; reading</h3><ul><li>Favourite movie</li><li>Favourite series</li><li>Favourite book</li></ul></div>
